  "description": "A powerful .NET library for intelligent document structure analysis and chunking. Automatically identifies and parses various document patterns including Markdown headings, numeric outlines, legal sections, and appendices. Features hierarchical content organization, advanced keyword extraction with ML.NET, and ONNX vectorization support for semantic embeddings.",
